<header class="hero">
    <h1>Ruqi Fahmi Sadad</h1>
    <p class="aka">Dikenal juga sebagai <strong>Ruqi Fahmi</strong></p>
    <p class="role">Data Analyst &amp; IT Development</p>
    <p class="place">PT Infomedia Nusantara · Jakarta, Indonesia</p>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://github.com/ruqi-fahmi" rel="me">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ruqi-fahmi-0896a41bb/" rel="me">LinkedIn</a>
